### REGISTER ADMIN AS A USER THEN PROMOTE TO ADMIN ON MYSQL DATABASE

POST http://localhost:8081/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Owenkosi",
  "lastName": "Nxasana",
  "email": "admin@incredibletech.co.za",
  "phoneNumber": "0631450774",
  "password": "Admin@123456789",
  "confirmPassword": "Admin@123456789"
}

